---
import SymbolsPage from "../components/SymbolsPage.astro";
---

<SymbolsPage lang="en">
  <article class="prose wrap max-w-[820px] mx-auto py-10">
    <h2>Symbols Copy and Paste</h2>
    <p>
      Looking for cool symbols to copy and paste into your social media posts, bios, messages, or usernames? Here you'll find a collection of aesthetic symbols, cute symbols, hearts, stars, arrows, and decorative characters that you can use anywhere.
    </p>
    <p>
      Simply browse the symbols, tap or click your favourite one to copy it, and paste it wherever you like. These Unicode symbols work on Instagram, Snapchat, TikTok, Discord, WhatsApp, and other platforms. No downloads or special fonts are needed!
    </p>
  </article>
</SymbolsPage>
